es against Emily Charlton (Emily Blunt), her former assistant turned rival executive, as they compete for advertising revenue amidst declining print media while Miranda nears retirement.\r\n\r\nTwenty years after making their iconic turns as Miranda, Andy, Emily and Nigel- Meryl Streep, Anne Hathaway, Emily Blunt and Stanley Tucci return to the fashionable streets of New York City and the sleek offices of Runway Magazine in 20th Century Studios’ “The Devil Wears Prada 2,” the eagerly awaited sequel to the 2006 phenomenon that defined a generation.</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"film-times\">\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"1492\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2026-05-01T11:00:00\" href=\"/bookings/1492/\">\n    11:00\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S3</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"1493\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2026-05-01T13:45:00\" href=\"/bookings/1493/\">\n    13:45\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span>\n        <span class=\"last-few\" style=\"display:none;\">(last few seats)</span>\n        \n        \n    \n    \n        <span class=\"screen\">S3</span>\n    \n</a>\n\n                                    \n                                        \n\n\n\n  \n\n<a class=\"performance-button button sm  \" data-perf-id=\"1494\" data-filters=\"\" data-start-time=\"2026-05-01T16:30:00\" href=\"/bookings/1494/\">\n    16:30\n    \n        <span class=\"sold-out\" style=\"display:none;\">sold out</span